CREATED:20260424T163204Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260424T163204Z
UID:10000358-1779388200-1779393600@hatefreetogether.org
SUMMARY:Davis City Council Meetings
DESCRIPTION:The Davis City Council provides policy direction\, establishes goals\, and sets priorities for City government. City Council holds regular meetings beginning at 6:30 p.m. on Tuesdays. Most commonly\, meetings are held on the first and third Tuesdays of the month\, with additional meetings scheduled as needed. The City Council meeting schedule is subject to change. \n  \nThe Davis City Council meets in the Community Chambers at City Hall\, 23 Russell Boulevard. All regular meeting materials are posted at least 72 hours in advance and special meeting materials at least 24 hours in advance. \n  \nVisit the City Council site for information on agenda\, special meetings\, and more.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/davis-city-council-meetings/2026-05-21/
LOCATION:City Hall Community Chambers\, 23 Russell Blvd\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/newmayor_ci_EVERETT_SMITH-scaled-e1777048191300.webp
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Hatefreetogether": "https://hatefreetogether.org/event/djusd-board-meetings/2026-05-21/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:hatefreetogether
X-SOURCE:Hate-Free Together
DTSTART;TZID=UTC:20260521T183000
DTEND;TZID=UTC:20260521T200000
DTSTAMP:20260512T035803
CREATED:20260424T172126Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260424T172314Z
UID:10000549-1779388200-1779393600@hatefreetogether.org
SUMMARY:DJUSD Board Meetings
DESCRIPTION:DJUSD Board meetings offer insight on how the school district remains responsive to the community’s values\, beliefs\, and priorities. The Board meetings occur on every first and third Thursday\, in the City of Davis Community Chambers. 23 Russell Boulevard. Public session starts at 6:30 PM.  Meetings are cablecast live on Channel 17 (Comcast) or streamed on the DJUSD-TV website. \n  \nThe Davis Joint Unified School District’s Board of Education is comprised of five community members\, responsible for setting district policy\, approving the budget\, and hiring the superintendent for schools in Davis\, California. The agendas for the meetings are posted at least 72 hours in advance. \n  \nFor more information on special meetings\, agendas\, public comment\, and more\, visit the DJUSD Board site.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/djusd-board-meetings/2026-05-21/
LOCATION:City Hall Community Chambers\, 23 Russell Blvd\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/499036487_1275464707915844_5079899038399820181_n.jpg
END:VEVENT
