SUMMARY:Arab Student Union Banquet
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T220000
UID:723ba8c0ab45e213ac7abe007cc64e7311182025_3:10:52_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a night of culture\, community\, and celebration a
 t the annual Arab Student Banquet\, hosted by the Arab Student Union at UC
  Davis! This unforgettable evening showcases the rich traditions of the Ar
 ab world through music\, dance\, cuisine\, and powerful student performanc
 es. Whether you're Arab or not\, come dressed to impress\, ready to enjoy 
 delicious food\, vibrant dabke\, and inspiring speakers. Let’s come toge
