 ploads/event/Screenshot%202025-08-22%20094306_20250822170959649858.jpg
DESCRIPTION:NEW TIME! CHANGE TO MORNING FOR SUMMER BEGINNING MAY 21: Join 
 the Woodland Visibility Brigade to make the Resistance VISIBLE! We resist 
 the authoritarian and fascist administration with a topical message and pu
 blicize upcoming local resistance events. We dance and wave and get lots o
 f friendly honks! You will receive an immediate confirmation email with pa
 rking and location details\, and a reminder one hour beforehand. Please ma
 ke sure you know where you're headed before you set out!
